i-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3055\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E6%99%AE%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B\" title=\"斯普特尼克\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E6%99%AE%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B\" title=\"斯普特尼克\"><img alt=\"斯普特尼克\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/90/HeadIconSmall-305501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E6%99%AE%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B\" title=\"斯普特尼克\">斯普特尼克</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>十六位狂欢</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305502</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">桑巴音乐源自巴西巴伊亚的一种音乐形式，它通常能给人带来热情愉快的感受。<br />在《桑巴星球》中，收录了数首桑巴音乐。斯普特尼克喜欢这种节奏明快、韵律感强的音乐作品。于是，她按照自己的印象，去购买了桑巴服装——在该款游戏的封面上，绘制着一只穿着桑巴服饰的猴子。<br />迪斯科的舞厅之内，她仍不知疲倦地旋转。即使在旧金山，依然能感到大西洋东岸的巴西风情。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305502\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/27/Belonging-305504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">传统桑巴服饰套装<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Samba Costume</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3.9<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>桑巴表演者所穿戴的传统服饰。<br />醒目的红色大领巾是受访者的手笔。在丰富的兼职生涯中，她曾见到过一只奇妙生物佩戴着此物，在沙滩上热情起舞。她就此认定这是合格的桑巴舞者的标志。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4e/Belonging-305505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">成对沙锤\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">“啪唦啪唦”</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Chik-Chak\" Maracas</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7.7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>使用传统工艺制作的一对沙锤，挥舞时会发出“啪唦啪唦”的奇妙音色。<br />如果在海边使用它，独特的响声似乎会引来某些调皮的朋友。此条写在了使用说明上。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ce/Belonging-305506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">某个忧郁的国度<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Photo of \"Les Tristes Tropiques\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一张真实性存疑的照片。据受访者所说，就连她也不清楚这是哪一个瞬间映照在自己身上的景色。<br />通过鉴定发现，照片似乎经过某种南美风格的艺术处理。至少这与受访者的打扮十分相称。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">吱，吱吱？！ <small style=\"color: grey\">Eek, Eek!</small></span></span>"}}